#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Time unit 'h' (hours) on mega328p
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 57,600,000,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim Xv As Byte
Dim Yv As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 1 h
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
